--- !u!1001 &448194365
PrefabInstance:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  serializedVersion: 2
  m_Modification:
    serializedVersion: 3
    m_TransformParent: {fileID: 103501272}
    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 1264023701884515191, guid: d03752a0db14c0d4cbf9bf420ca053e4,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.size
      value: 15
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1264023701884515191, guid: d03752a0db14c0d4cbf9bf420ca053e4,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[3].Text
      value: Hmmm... we will cross paths again.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1264023701884515191, guid: d03752a0db14c0d4cbf9bf420ca053e4,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[4].Text
      value: Dude, I hope not.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1264023701884515191, guid: d03752a0db14c0d4cbf9bf420ca053e4,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[5].Text
      value: Thanks for saving us! However can we repay you?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1264023701884515191, guid: d03752a0db14c0d4cbf9bf420ca053e4,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[6].Text
      value: "Are you the ones who\u2019ve been hogging all the cheese?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1264023701884515191, guid: d03752a0db14c0d4cbf9bf420ca053e4,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[7].Text
      value: "Cheese? We know nothing of cheese. We are bakers of bread here. If
        it\u2019s cheese you want, the rats are the ones to ask."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1264023701884515191, guid: d03752a0db14c0d4cbf9bf420ca053e4,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[8].Text
      value: Their cheese was stole, meow!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1264023701884515191, guid: d03752a0db14c0d4cbf9bf420ca053e4,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[9].Text
      value: Do you have any clues that might lead us to a thief?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1264023701884515191, guid: d03752a0db14c0d4cbf9bf420ca053e4,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[10].Text
      value: Hm.. Well not cheese but one of our pigs was taken by a dragon that
        lives up the mountain.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1264023701884515191, guid: d03752a0db14c0d4cbf9bf420ca053e4,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[11].Text
      value: "Its taking a nap just over there past the end of our village!\r\nPerhaps
        the dragon is also the cheese thief you are searching for?\r"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1264023701884515191, guid: d03752a0db14c0d4cbf9bf420ca053e4,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[12].Text
      value: "A <shake a=0.2>dragon</shake>? Can we go kill it. Pleaaaaassseee.\r"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1264023701884515191, guid: d03752a0db14c0d4cbf9bf420ca053e4,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[13].Text
      value: "We'll go investigate. Thanks for the help.\r"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1264023701884515191, guid: d03752a0db14c0d4cbf9bf420ca053e4,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[14].Text
      value: Thank you!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1264023701884515191, guid: d03752a0db14c0d4cbf9bf420ca053e4,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[3].character
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 951e0b6242b07e746a6494341f74afc9,
